1449
01:28:26,480 --> 01:28:27,220
No, no, no, no.

1450
01:28:27,920 --> 01:28:28,740
Damn, I don't know.

1451
01:28:32,160 --> 01:28:35,240
Oh, man, uh...

1452
01:28:38,110 --> 01:28:39,450
Yeah, I... shit.

1453
