Help, perhaps?

1466
01:29:36,320 --> 01:29:36,840
Help plants.

1467
01:29:38,820 --> 01:29:40,020
They helped the plants.

1468
01:29:43,080 --> 01:29:47,660
Okay, maybe it's just plants in plural this time, so instead of saying...

1469
01:29:49,020 --> 01:29:50,500
