1470
01:29:50,880 --> 01:29:51,740
It was one guy, right?

1471
01:29:52,680 --> 01:29:53,960
Helped the plants.

1472
01:29:55,380 --> 01:29:55,720
No?

1473
01:29:59,440 --> 01:30:00,980
Uh, shit, I don't know.

1474
