I'm seeing... people on the left, and...

1479
01:30:42,850 --> 01:30:45,130
Hold on, are we doing warriors open the door?

1480
01:30:53,530 --> 01:30:54,590
Instead of closing it?

1481
01:30:57,350 --> 01:30:59,750
Oh my God, I don't know!

1482
01:30:59,750 --> 01:31:04,070
I don't recall the first mural!

1483
