Let's try going all the way back here.

1486
01:31:25,230 --> 01:31:26,350
Yeah, what's down here?

1487
01:31:31,730 --> 01:31:32,750
What the frick?

1488
01:31:40,530 --> 01:31:43,010
Oh, you're kidding me, there's more clues down here!

1489
01:31:47,720 --> 01:31:49,120
That was a plural sign.

1490
01:31:50,560 --> 01:31:51,740
In the alchemist language.

1491
01:31:59,200 --> 01:32:00,940
Oh, there it is.

1492
01:32:01,420 --> 01:32:02,780
There it is, dude.

1493
01:32:07,820 --> 01:32:09,700
Yeah, that's what I was trying to say!

1494
01:32:10,600 --> 01:32:11,920
The alchemist helped the plants!

1495
01:32:18,520 --> 01:32:20,600
Okay, created formula, maybe?

1496
01:32:29,360 --> 01:32:29,920
So...

1497
01:32:29,920 --> 01:32:30,720
Formula was down there.

1498
01:32:33,800 --> 01:32:36,040
Do we have other pieces lying around, other than this one?

1499
