Why can't I interact with this?

1500
01:32:41,850 --> 01:32:42,970
That's plural, isn't it?

1501
01:32:46,060 --> 01:32:47,000
Let's see here, that one.

1502
01:32:48,000 --> 01:32:49,460
Yeah, that looks like plural to me.

1503
01:32:51,680 --> 01:32:51,720
Okay.

1504
01:32:56,640 --> 01:32:58,040
I guess we try to do that.

1505
01:33:00,360 --> 01:33:00,940
Why not?

1506
01:33:07,140 --> 01:33:08,780
Okay, that didn't do anything.

1507
01:33:10,220 --> 01:33:11,080
Why did I do that?

1508
01:33:11,760 --> 01:33:12,360
I don't know.

1509
01:33:23,940 --> 01:33:24,760
Yeah, alright.

1510
01:33:25,140 --> 01:33:25,820
Let's go back up.

1511
01:33:25,820 --> 01:33:28,540
Let's try combinations with formula now.

1512
01:33:29,680 --> 01:33:30,580
They created formula.

1513
01:33:31,800 --> 01:33:32,140
Formula one.

1514
01:33:39,930 --> 01:33:44,130
I was trying to click up there and see if he would run all the way up on his own, but he didn't.

1515
01:33:47,180 --> 01:33:48,220
Literally unplayable.

1516
01:33:53,740 --> 01:33:55,900
Okay, so alchemist created brondo.

1517
01:33:57,660 --> 01:33:58,980
That healed the plants.

1518
01:34:04,760 --> 01:34:07,160
So, we are going to say...

1519
01:34:09,560 --> 01:34:09,960
alchemists.

1520
01:34:12,860 --> 01:34:13,960
God, where were you?

1521
01:34:19,070 --> 01:34:19,470
Create.

1522
01:34:28,340 --> 01:34:29,080
Come on.

1523
01:34:32,030 --> 01:34:32,970
God, I swear to God.

1524
01:34:33,290 --> 01:34:37,350
Like, having to sift through all these every time is probably the worst part about this game.

1525
01:34:37,390 --> 01:34:39,550
They should really have added a search function, or something.

1526
01:34:40,230 --> 01:34:41,610
To the ones I've already discovered.

1527
01:34:42,350 --> 01:34:43,670
Then have them highlighted, you know?

1528
01:34:45,170 --> 01:34:46,610
Ah, worst create, dammit.

1529
01:34:50,280 --> 01:34:51,640
I'm going through everyone again.

1530
01:34:51,840 --> 01:34:52,260
Let's see.

1531
01:34:58,160 --> 01:34:59,160
It's not even here.

1532
01:35:17,400 --> 01:35:17,520
Make.

1533
01:35:18,200 --> 01:35:18,860
Thank you.

1534
01:35:20,080 --> 01:35:20,180
Formula.

1535
01:35:22,660 --> 01:35:23,460
Where is that?

1536
01:35:29,180 --> 01:35:29,500
There.

1537
01:35:30,080 --> 01:35:30,520
Okay.

1538
