Oh, hey!

1539
01:35:32,040 --> 01:35:32,820
Oh, he's angry.

1540
01:35:34,000 --> 01:35:34,720
Oh, my God.

1541
01:35:36,040 --> 01:35:37,200
Oh, shit.

1542
01:35:39,200 --> 01:35:39,680
Run!

1543
01:35:43,380 --> 01:35:44,020
Oh, God.

1544
01:35:44,360 --> 01:35:44,520
Run!

1545
01:35:46,560 --> 01:35:46,920
Quick.

1546
01:35:47,120 --> 01:35:47,460
Oh, my God.

1547
01:35:47,520 --> 01:35:48,300
This is all fucked up.

1548
01:35:49,620 --> 01:35:50,420
Don't look back.

1549
01:35:51,000 --> 01:35:51,480
Keep going.

1550
01:35:53,540 --> 01:35:54,420
Down, down, down, down, down, down.

1551
01:35:54,560 --> 01:35:55,440
What the hell?

1552
01:35:57,800 --> 01:35:58,260
Reality ain't real.

1553
01:35:59,980 --> 01:36:00,280
Uh-oh.

1554
01:36:00,780 --> 01:36:01,700
Okay, I'm coming, I'm coming.

1555
01:36:03,180 --> 01:36:03,860
Thank you, child.

1556
01:36:05,340 --> 01:36:06,320
There's skulls everywhere.

1557
