Where do I go?

1559
01:36:19,420 --> 01:36:21,480
Up, up, up, up, up.

1560
01:36:21,540 --> 01:36:21,940
This way.

1561
01:36:23,280 --> 01:36:23,340
Here.

1562
01:36:25,280 --> 01:36:25,500
Shit!

1563
01:36:32,300 --> 01:36:32,840
What's the way?

1564
01:36:34,420 --> 01:36:34,740
Left.

1565
01:36:36,700 --> 01:36:37,020
Down.

1566
01:36:38,360 --> 01:36:38,860
Where am I going?

1567
01:36:40,820 --> 01:36:41,840
Okay, okay, we gotta go north.

1568
01:36:43,600 --> 01:36:44,080
This way.

1569
01:36:44,780 --> 01:36:45,500
Up, up, up, up, up.

1570
01:36:45,880 --> 01:36:47,100
No, don't click the book, you idiot.

1571
01:36:48,300 --> 01:36:48,800
Right, right, right.

1572
01:36:48,920 --> 01:36:49,340
Go, go, go.

1573
01:36:50,720 --> 01:36:51,560
Go right, right.

1574
01:36:52,940 --> 01:36:53,340
Good.

1575
01:36:54,140 --> 01:36:54,560
Keep going.

1576
01:36:54,840 --> 01:36:55,760
I don't care, everything's upside down.

1577
01:36:56,460 --> 01:36:56,780
Water's coming.

1578
01:36:58,800 --> 01:36:59,120
Exiles.

1579
