I'm still on top of the tower, aren't I?

1589
01:37:30,800 --> 01:37:31,420
Hug me, friend.

1590
01:37:31,820 --> 01:37:32,140
Wait, what?

1591
01:37:34,840 --> 01:37:35,560
Is that me?

1592
01:37:45,020 --> 01:37:45,460
Wait.

1593
01:37:48,080 --> 01:37:49,620
Have I been...

1594
01:37:50,700 --> 01:37:53,120
in exile this entire time?

1595
01:37:54,000 --> 01:37:55,360
Since the beginning of the game?

1596
01:37:56,620 --> 01:37:58,680
Or was I brought here by this guy?

1597
01:37:59,620 --> 01:38:00,500
At the very end.

1598
01:38:01,200 --> 01:38:02,400
When I was on top of the tower.

1599
01:38:02,700 --> 01:38:03,540
There's only two solutions.

1600
01:38:06,220 --> 01:38:06,420
Oh.

1601
01:38:07,700 --> 01:38:08,880
I was in there.

1602
01:38:15,410 --> 01:38:15,650
Greetings.

1603
01:38:16,050 --> 01:38:16,850
You stopped exile.

1604
01:38:17,970 --> 01:38:19,490
You revived my people.

1605
01:38:21,110 --> 01:38:21,810
I did.

1606
01:38:22,510 --> 01:38:22,990
I did.

1607
01:38:24,750 --> 01:38:25,250
Everyone...

1608
01:38:25,250 --> 01:38:26,950
is now free to take a break from gaming.

1609
01:38:32,340 --> 01:38:33,060
They're grateful.

1610
01:38:34,000 --> 01:38:35,020
You helped my people.

1611
01:38:35,360 --> 01:38:35,920
Exile is dead.

1612
01:38:36,560 --> 01:38:37,000
And...

1613
01:38:37,820 --> 01:38:39,200
exile truly is dead.

1614
01:38:41,540 --> 01:38:41,920
Which way?

1615
01:38:45,260 --> 01:38:46,060
Let's go in here.

1616
01:38:50,530 --> 01:38:51,830
Let's see if the dude is still here.

1617
01:38:55,060 --> 01:38:55,540
Are you in here?

1618
01:38:58,200 --> 01:38:59,460
Oh, I think he's gone.

1619
01:39:00,580 --> 01:39:02,080
I want to sit in here.

1620
01:39:02,880 --> 01:39:04,860
I want to place my body inside of there.

1621
01:39:04,940 --> 01:39:05,180
What's this?

1622
01:39:09,540 --> 01:39:11,320
Right, it's showing me all the doors.

1623
01:39:19,240 --> 01:39:20,100
That's okay, though.

1624
01:39:20,620 --> 01:39:21,420
We move on.

1625
01:39:22,920 --> 01:39:23,560
This way.

1626
01:39:25,540 --> 01:39:27,800
Dude, the game totally faked me out with that ending.

1627
01:39:28,620 --> 01:39:29,360
Or fake ending.

1628
01:39:30,080 --> 01:39:32,460
Look at him, they're having a post-gaming discussion.

1629
01:39:39,090 --> 01:39:39,890
What's down here?

1630
01:39:45,970 --> 01:39:46,750
And what about up there?

1631
01:39:47,930 --> 01:39:49,370
I want to see if anything's changed.

1632
01:39:51,410 --> 01:39:52,590
Okay, then I'm back here.

1633
01:39:53,790 --> 01:39:54,850
So if I go down this way now...

1634
01:40:00,140 --> 01:40:00,700
Aha!

1635
01:40:01,600 --> 01:40:02,740
The bottom part.

1636
01:40:08,400 --> 01:40:09,120
You came to help us.

1637
01:40:09,260 --> 01:40:09,940
You stopped exile.

1638
01:40:10,100 --> 01:40:10,520
I sure did.

1639
01:40:10,640 --> 01:40:11,480
Have I been down here?

1640
01:40:14,300 --> 01:40:16,460
Oh, let's see if we understand this now.

1641
01:40:20,280 --> 01:40:21,180
The tower.

1642
01:40:21,740 --> 01:40:22,160
The people.

1643
01:40:25,090 --> 01:40:26,950
We are the people of exile.

1644
01:40:30,620 --> 01:40:32,560
We welcome the peoples of the tower.

1645
01:40:35,580 --> 01:40:36,140
Oh...

1646
01:40:36,140 --> 01:40:37,480
I get it.

1647
01:40:39,540 --> 01:40:40,820
It all makes sense.

1648
01:40:41,240 --> 01:40:42,680
Well, no surprise, I guess.

1649
01:40:43,820 --> 01:40:44,960
Since we figured out the language.

1650
01:40:45,800 --> 01:40:48,400
Okay, let's head up to the door again.

1651
01:40:52,900 --> 01:40:59,640
So I was actually in exile the entire time, controlling another body of mine in this place?

1652
01:41:01,240 --> 01:41:06,040
But wouldn't that sort of suggest that this place is also a simulation?

1653
01:41:09,340 --> 01:41:19,160
Unless I went on top of the tower, I got captured by one of the sentries, brought down here, put into that room, marked exile.

1654
01:41:20,960 --> 01:41:21,940
And then stuff happened.

1655
01:41:22,060 --> 01:41:23,140
Look at this, this is off now.

1656
01:41:24,840 --> 01:41:25,540
Because of me.

1657
01:41:29,700 --> 01:41:30,060
Go.

1658
01:41:35,920 --> 01:41:37,080
Oh, look at this!

1659
01:41:37,480 --> 01:41:38,160
It's all happy.

1660
01:41:40,320 --> 01:41:41,300
I love happy.

1661
01:41:43,240 --> 01:41:44,380
The colors are good.

1662
01:41:44,620 --> 01:41:45,280
No more rain.

1663
01:41:46,000 --> 01:41:46,800
The clouds are gone.

1664
01:41:47,560 --> 01:41:48,960
Never mind, the clouds are still here, but they're beautiful.

1665
01:41:50,620 --> 01:41:51,440
Pretty clouds.

1666
01:41:53,800 --> 01:41:54,580
Run, little man!

1667
01:41:56,080 --> 01:41:56,400
Faster!

1668
01:41:57,140 --> 01:41:57,440
Come on!

1669
01:41:57,980 --> 01:41:59,080
Move those feet of yours.

1670
01:42:03,680 --> 01:42:07,100
Okay, I was half expecting a tunnel of light this time, but okay.

1671
01:42:07,740 --> 01:42:08,720
I'll take it.

1672
01:42:10,400 --> 01:42:11,500
Look at everyone's here!

1673
01:42:15,190 --> 01:42:15,970
What's up, guys?

1674
01:42:19,470 --> 01:42:20,070
Hey!

1675
01:42:23,630 --> 01:42:25,770
I mean, they're still sort of isolated a little bit.

1676
01:42:25,950 --> 01:42:27,750
They stay in their cliques, but okay.

1677
01:42:30,430 --> 01:42:31,470
Guys, start mingling!

1678
01:42:41,520 --> 01:42:42,820
Establishing connections, literally.

1679
01:42:43,880 --> 01:42:46,280
That's what that represents, of course.

1680
01:42:47,260 --> 01:42:48,560
Oh, it's God!

1681
01:42:50,100 --> 01:42:51,980
It's all kinds of things.

1682
01:42:54,020 --> 01:42:55,300
Oh, that's cool.

1683
01:42:56,560 --> 01:42:58,180
You can create all the languages.

1684
01:42:58,940 --> 01:43:00,300
It's the ultimate Rosetta Stone.

1685
01:43:04,810 --> 01:43:05,650
They're mingling!

1686
01:43:07,950 --> 01:43:09,150
Where's the Hochduvrat?

1687
01:43:10,950 --> 01:43:12,290
Where's the finger food?

1688
01:43:13,850 --> 01:43:14,410
Delicious snacks.

1689
01:43:15,890 --> 01:43:16,570
Where's the champagne?

1690
01:43:21,890 --> 01:43:22,790
This is great.

1691
01:43:24,450 --> 01:43:26,830
The child is finally conversing with me.

1692
01:43:36,440 --> 01:43:38,000
Oh, that's nice.

1693
01:43:42,410 --> 01:43:43,590
That is so good.

1694
01:43:45,850 --> 01:43:48,370
What a beautiful ending and what a fakeout.

1695
01:43:50,230 --> 01:43:54,510
I legitimately thought I had reached the ending and that I perhaps had done something wrong.

1696
01:43:55,870 --> 01:44:01,890
I thought, oh, did I miss a power source to turn off somewhere so that I actually got a bad ending or somehow?

1697
01:44:03,250 --> 01:44:03,750
But no!

1698
01:44:03,750 --> 01:44:08,760
I did it right!

1699
01:44:14,060 --> 01:44:14,920
Oh, that's so nice.

1700
01:44:17,360 --> 01:44:18,620
Is it going to zoom all the way out?

1701
01:44:20,320 --> 01:44:21,400
